# Projects layout

## Case detail template (`/projects/[slug]`) — STANDARD

Living reference: [`components/ProjectCaseDemo.tsx`](components/ProjectCaseDemo.tsx) + `.project-case-demo*` in [`app/globals.css`](app/globals.css) (mounted on `/projects/[slug]`; `/about` is bio-only).

This is the **only** case-detail pattern. Do not revive the old always-on Background / Challenges / Execution / Impact chapter stack on detail pages.

### 1. Full-viewport video hero

- Height `100svh` / `100vh`, pulled under sticky header (`margin-top: -header-offset`).
- Full-bleed media (site video / ProtectedVideo or project hero source).
- Overlay copy **bottom-left**, shell-aligned: eyebrow (optional) · title · short summary · tags.
- Nav at rest: clear / over-clear on the video (same as home).

### 2. Image gallery (content band)

- Shell width: `min(var(--shell-max), calc(100% - var(--shell-gutter) * 2))` — **do not invent local outer padding**.
- Vertical stack of full-width frames + 2-up pairs.
- Row gap between blocks = `--shell-gutter`.
- Pair (side-by-side) gap tighter: `calc(var(--shell-gutter) * 0.35)` from `800px` up.
- Images are **display-only** (no lightbox) unless a project explicitly asks otherwise.

### 3. “About the project” control

- Shell-fixed (portaled), **not** parented inside the media column — open-push must not move X.
- Activity band = real media stack (and when open, taller of media vs copy). Never over the video; never into Related.
- Travels with content top → docks near viewport bottom → clamps in the **gap under the last frame** (`min(relatedTop, bodyBottom, footerTop)`), not onto the images.
- Font weight **Medium (500)**.
- Desktop scroll uses **Lenis** (`lenis.scrollTo`, `immediate: true`); `window.scrollTo` alone is not enough.

### 4. About panel (toggle)

- Closed: images full width; panel collapsed (`height: 0`) so hidden copy does **not** inflate gallery height.
- Open: media ~60% / panel ~40%; media gets `padding-right: var(--shell-gutter)` (image↔copy gap).
- Panel slides in; media width eases (push, not hard snap).
- Copy + meta flow with images (**no sticky drift**) so tops stay aligned.
- On open: jump so **copy line 1** is under the header (Lenis immediate scroll).
- Mobile: full-screen overlay panel + body scroll lock; keep a Close control.

### 5. Copy / type (dark detail page)

- Detail surfaces are black (`#000`). Titles and body copy both `#fff` (same white). Set color on `.project-case-demo__panel-copy p` — global `p { color: var(--muted) }` otherwise wins.
- Separate heading + paragraph blocks with clear title→body gap (not `<strong>` + `<br>` in one `<p>`).
- Structure: project narrative blocks + meta (Client / Sector / Discipline / Partners / team as data allows).

