## Cover ratios (index)

1. **Featured lead (first)** — `1920 × 1080` (exact 16:9).
2. **Two-column cards** — `3000 × 1687` (~16:9; use `aspect-ratio: 3000 / 1687`).

## Featured lead meta (full width)

Further-style single row: **title left** · **tagline center** · **tags right** (` · ` separators).

## Two-column card meta (match reference)

Under the image:

```
TITLE (left, bold/heavy)          TAGS (right, light, comma-separated)
Tagline under the title (left)
```

Not a three-column horizontal bar. Title and tags share the top baseline; copy sits under the title.

These fields feed the filter system later — keep as structured data.

## Page arrangement (`/projects`)

1. **Hero**
2. **Featured lead** — full width; **always above the filter**; never tied to filter results (see `fixed-featured-leads.mdc`). Change only when the user explicitly asks.
3. **Filter** — centered involvement pills
4. **Everything after** — **two equal-width columns** (filtered list, lead slug excluded). Same meta stack on every card.

## Do not

- Return to irregular masonry / auto-fill multi-column grids for the showcase
- Mix the featured three-column meta into two-column cards (or vice versa)
- Use the old four-chapter (Background → Challenges → Execution → Impact) stack as the case detail template
- Parent the About button inside the media column (it will slide left on open)
- Leave closed About copy in normal flow (it inflates height and breaks the button band)
- Change site `--shell-gutter` / outer shell padding for local “tweaks” on the case template
